      "claims": "Sixteen membrane switches in a 4x4 matrix, each joining its row to its column with the contact resistance when pressed (1 GOhm open), bouncing on press and release when `bounce` is on, so several keys held together join rows and columns as the real matrix does (ghosting included).",
